      "description": "## Admin Login\n\nThis folder covers the **admin authentication flow** for the EventHub API. It contains the two core requests needed to establish and verify an authenticated session:\n\n| Request | Method | Endpoint |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Login with existing credentials | `POST` | `/auth/login` |\n| Get the currently authenticated user | `GET` | `/auth/me` |\n\n### Purpose\n\n- Authenticate an admin user using existing credentials and obtain a bearer token via `POST /auth/login`.\n- Confirm the session is valid by retrieving the currently authenticated user's profile via `GET /auth/me`.\n\n> The bearer token returned from login is expected to be stored in an environment variable (e.g. `{{authToken}}`) and used by downstream requests that require authorization."
    },
